---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Nick Ruffin | Pharmacy-Data Monetization">
  <div class="container">
    <Hero />

    <section class="focus-section">
      <div class="focus-content">
        <span class="section-tag reveal">FOCUS</span>
        <h3 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Pharmacy data, commercialized under HIPAA.</h3>
        <p class="focus-lede reveal reveal-delay-1">
          The software sits inside the pharmacy and the switch carries the claim, so the program captures the raw NCPDP transmission whole &mdash; the pharmacy's request, the routing header, the processor's response, and the adjudication itself. <strong>A dataset assembled downstream of adjudication cannot be made to look like this one</strong>, which is what makes it licensable rather than merely available.
        </p>
        <div class="focus-grid">
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <div class="card-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Patient-level tokenization</h4>
            <p>Unlocks patient matching through overlap analysis against a customer's own population, then longitudinal linkage into the medical claims and lab data they already hold.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <div class="card-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 8h20"/><path d="M6 12h4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Customer-controlled AWS or Azure</h4>
            <p>Identified data landed inside customer-owned environments for buyers running their own tokenization engines &mdash; DUA-governed, HIPAA-compliant, provenance-tracked.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <div class="card-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Cross-source combined feeds</h4>
            <p>One shared pipeline joining multiple pharmacy systems, so customers and internal teams work from a single consistent data shape.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="platform-section">
      <div class="focus-content">
        <span class="section-tag reveal">WHAT I SOLVED</span>
        <h3 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Problems, and what each one unlocked.</h3>
        <div class="focus-grid">
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <h4>Raw transmissions were a record, not a product</h4>
            <p>Shaped them into a commercial data product held to NCPDP standards, so one asset answers a different question per buyer. It runs today as a multi-year licensed portfolio that has renewed and expanded every cycle.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <h4>De-identified claims could not follow a patient</h4>
            <p>My team engineered the patient-level tokenization engine, which opened the real-world evidence and patient-journey segment: customers measure overlap against their own population before buying, then link our history to theirs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <h4>None of it could be sold without a HIPAA determination</h4>
            <p>I run Expert Determination with third-party evaluators, which paired with the data-rights terms in our pharmacy agreements ungated commercial use across the network.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <h4>Two acquisitions left every feed inconsistent</h4>
            <p>Consolidated the platform onto one pipeline and ran the customer renewal project alongside it with business development and sales. No monetization commitment goes out without my delivery review.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <h4>Manufacturers could not see what their money bought</h4>
            <p>I own delivery of the reporting behind our copay assistance, voucher, and clinical programs, showing the abandonment at the counter a program prevented and whether the behavior it paid for changed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <h4>Delivery could not be audited or scaled</h4>
            <p>My team rebuilt it as a governed enterprise platform: infrastructure defined as code, access controlled per customer, every transfer monitored and evidenced, and new customers onboarded as configuration rather than a build.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/experience" class="platform-cta reveal reveal-delay-3">See the full experience &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .container { width: 100%; position: relative; overflow-x: hidden; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .section-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: block;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .focus-section {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--background-color);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    color: var(--text-color);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .focus-section::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: -50%;
    width: 200%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02) 0%, transparent 50%);
    animation: sectionGradient 15s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  @keyframes sectionGradient { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(10%); } }

  .focus-content { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .focus-content h3 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-color); }
  .focus-lede { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto 3.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .focus-lede strong { color: var(--text-color); font-weight: 600; }
  .focus-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }

  .focus-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.4s;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    position: relative;
  }
  .focus-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }
  .card-icon { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--primary-color); }
  .focus-card h4 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-color); }
  .focus-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }

  .platform-section {
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    color: var(--text-color);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .platform-content { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .platform-content h3 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .platform-lede { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .platform-cta { color: var(--primary-color); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; transition: opacity 0.3s; }
  .platform-cta:hover { opacity: 0.7; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .focus-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .focus-content h3, .platform-content h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .focus-section, .platform-section { padding: 60px 16px; }
  }
</style>
